    "attributes": {
        "action": "Mandate collection & publication of criminals\u2019 immigration status & nationality",
        "additional_details": "We call for full transparency: the mandatory collection and publication of all crime statistics broken down by nationality and immigration status including asylum seekers and illegal immigrants for the past five years, so the public can hold all political institutions, politicians, and external organisations to account.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to mandate the collection and publication of all crime statistics broken down by immigration status and nationality for the past 5 years, including data on illegal immigrants and asylum seekers, in the interest of transparency and public accountability.",
